{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://frankenrobotics.local/schemas/registries/gates.schema.json",
  "title": "FrankenRobotics Gate Registry (frob.gates/1)",
  "description": "Single schema for registries/gates.toml: first-commit BD-002 layout extended additively by N38b-18 (base record, seven closed claims, seven reconciled statuses, kill-row exemption) and extended additively by N40-01 (register layer). Status is recorded per [[gate.part]] (40 convergence gates including GATE-MARROW-01, GATE-HAB-01, GATE-HAB-13, GATE-ARENA-01, GATE-LEMMA-03 plus 3 admission gates carry multi-milestone parts per N40-02 step 5) and derived for each gate.",
  "$comment": "VALIDATOR CONTRACT (enforced by N40-01): (1) claim takes one of the seven closed strings; 'method' and 'Performance of the method' are rejected and map to 'design-comparison' only by explicit row edit. (2) status is the reconciled union of seven values: not-run (printed 'not run', never passed), pass, fail (requires measured + register-layer commit, command, resolving receipt), killed (names kill gate and adopted fallback in detail; printed 'killed: fallback adopted (<fallback>)'), blocked (names OPEN-id in detail; printed 'blocked: OPEN-...'), no-claim (terminal, valid only for claim='reality' import-lane gates), superseded (names successor gate in detail). (3) pass is refused in four cases: (a) controls is empty; (b) any listed control was not caught in the same run as the passing measurement; (c) recorded.session is a member of recorded.implemented_by (sorted comma-joined implementing sessions, N38b-19); (d) an evidence item or claim_id does not resolve in the artifact graph (FROB-REF-869), or the part receipt does not name a committed receipts/gates/<hash>.json whose bytes hash to it. (4) measured carries the measured value with unit/interval or count, never empty and never byte-equal to threshold. (5) Gate identifiers are unique and append-only; retired IDs are tombstoned, never reused. (6) Milestone exit requires every gate with a due part to be pass or killed with fallback adopted. (7) kind='kill' rows measure nothing and must never carry claim, claim_id, threshold, tier, controls, or [[gate.part]].",
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["schema"],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
    "schema": {
      "const": "frob.gates/1"
    },
    "gate": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/gate_row"
      }
    }
  },
  "$defs": {
    "milestone": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": ["M0", "M1", "M2", "M3", "M4", "M5", "M6", "M7", "M8"]
    },
    "gate_kind": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Gate row kind (optional on pre-N40-01 base rows; kill rows carry no measurement fields).",
      "enum": ["admission", "convergence", "program", "kill"]
    },
    "claim_kind": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Closed set of seven claim kinds; 'method' and 'Performance of the method' are rejected and require explicit edit to 'design-comparison'.",
      "enum": [
        "proof",
        "known-answer",
        "parity",
        "fidelity",
        "design-comparison",
        "reality",
        "performance"
      ]
    },
    "part_status": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Reconciled union of seven per-part statuses: six base values plus register-layer 'blocked'.",
      "enum": [
        "not-run",
        "pass",
        "fail",
        "killed",
        "blocked",
        "no-claim",
        "superseded"
      ]
    },
    "recorded": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["date", "session", "implemented_by"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "date": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "session": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "implemented_by": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Sorted, comma-joined session identifiers of all implementers; pass is refused if recorded.session is a member (condition c)."
        }
      }
    },
    "gate_part": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["milestone", "status", "measured", "evidence", "recorded"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "milestone": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/milestone"
        },
        "status": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/part_status"
        },
        "measured": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Measured value with unit/interval or count; never empty or byte-equal to threshold on pass."
        },
        "evidence": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          }
        },
        "recorded": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/recorded"
        },
        "kill_gate": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "fallback": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "open_question": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "detail": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": { "status": { "const": "pass" } },
            "required": ["status"]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "measured": { "minLength": 1 },
              "recorded": {
                "properties": {
                  "session": { "minLength": 1 }
                },
                "required": ["session"]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": { "status": { "const": "killed" } },
            "required": ["status"]
          },
          "then": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "required": ["kill_gate", "fallback"],
                "properties": {
                  "kill_gate": { "minLength": 1 },
                  "fallback": { "minLength": 1 }
                }
              },
              {
                "required": ["detail"],
                "properties": {
                  "detail": { "minLength": 1 }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": { "status": { "const": "blocked" } },
            "required": ["status"]
          },
          "then": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "required": ["open_question"],
                "properties": {
                  "open_question": { "minLength": 1 }
                }
              },
              {
                "required": ["detail"],
                "properties": {
                  "detail": { "minLength": 1 }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": { "status": { "const": "superseded" } },
            "required": ["status"]
          },
          "then": {
            "required": ["detail"],
            "properties": {
              "detail": { "minLength": 1 }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "gate_row": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["id", "section"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "kind": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/gate_kind"
        },
        "claim": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/claim_kind"
        },
        "claim_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "section": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "threshold": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "milestone": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/milestone"
        },
        "decided": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/milestone",
          "description": "Milestone at which a kill gate is decided (kill rows only)."
        },
        "tier": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          }
        },
        "controls": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          }
        },
        "part": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/gate_part"
          }
        }
      },
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": { "kind": { "const": "kill" } },
            "required": ["kind"]
          },
          "then": {
            "not": {
              "anyOf": [
                { "required": ["claim"] },
                { "required": ["claim_id"] },
                { "required": ["threshold"] },
                { "required": ["tier"] },
                { "required": ["controls"] },
                { "required": ["part"] }
              ]
            }
          },
          "else": {
            "required": [
              "id",
              "claim",
              "claim_id",
              "section",
              "threshold",
              "milestone",
              "tier",
              "controls"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "part": {
                "contains": {
                  "properties": { "status": { "const": "pass" } },
                  "required": ["status"]
                }
              }
            },
            "required": ["part"]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "controls": { "minItems": 1 }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "part": {
                "contains": {
                  "properties": { "status": { "const": "no-claim" } },
                  "required": ["status"]
                }
              }
            },
            "required": ["part"]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "claim": { "const": "reality" }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
